***** *****/*****/***** *****:***** PM  CLINICAL HISTORY: <33>52 yo female</33> with <34>metastatic pancreas ca</34>, baseline prior to starting treatment  COMPARISON: None  TECHNIQUE: Serial 1.25 mm axial images through the <35>chest</35> were obtained after 
