n: <40>Negative</40> (tumor is <41>19 cm</41> from margin). - Pancreatic parenchymal margin: <42>Negative</42> (tumor is <43>3.2 cm</43> from margin). - Uncinate (retroperitoneal) margin: <44>Negative</44> (tumor is <45>2.5 cm</45> from margin). - <46>Bile duct</46>
