 and <52>liver biopsy</52> by Dr. ***** at *****. <53>Pathology</53>(+) <54>5.5cm well-differentiated neuroendocrine tumor</54>, <55>grade 1</55> (<56>ki-67%</56> <57><2%</57>) with <58>lymphovascular and perineural invasion</58>. May <59>42 lymph nodes</59> were involved with <60>metastatic disease</60>. The <61>liver biopsy</61> showed <62>chronic hepatitis B</62>, <63>fibrosis grade 0</63> and <64>multifocal</64> ***** <65>hepatocellular necrosis</65>.     The post-operative course was complicated 
