e following: - <45>Persistent but gradually resolving peripheral sensory neuropathy</45>, somewhat affecting fine motor tasks - Somewhat <46>fatigued</46>, although still working (mostly from home) - Complete <47>alopecia</47> - Uses <48>oxycodone</48> sparingly for total body 'tightness'/suffocating feeling that occurs
