ed to any billed procedures. This time includes time spent with the patient as well as time spent documenting 
 in the medical record, reviewing patient's records and tests, obtaining history, placing orders, communicating with other healthcare professionals, counseling the patient, family, or caregiver, and/or care coordination for the diagnoses above.    ***** *****, MD, MPH  <23>Gastrointestinal Oncology</23>
