ner_results: ```plaintext
<1>pulmonary nodule</1> noted in <2>December 2013</2>, was noted to increase to <3>1.3 cm</3>. This <4>pulmonary nodule</4> was spiculated and located in the <5>left lung apex</5>. Otherwise, there was <6>postsurgical changes</6> with <7>soft tissue</7> and <8>stranding</8> within the <9>celiac artery</9> and <10>pancreatectomy resection beds</10> which had increased from <11>11/28/2012</11> but unchanged from <12>12/23/2013</12>. This was thought to reflect <13>posttreatment changes</13>. <14>CA 19-9 level</14> has continued to stay in the normal range. On <15>08/30/2014</15>, <16>pulmonary lesion</16> in the <17>peri fissural left lower lobe</17> was biopsied via <18>CT guidance</18>. During that examination, the <19>nodule</19> was noted to be <20>1.6x1.4 cm</20>. Pathology showed <21>adenocarcinoma</21>, consistent with <22>metastasis</22> from ***** ***** (IHC positive for <23>CK7</23> with patchy focal expression of *****; negative for ***** and <24>TTF-1</24>).
``` 
