ner_results: ```plaintext
<1>5000 cGy</1> (out of <2>5000 cGy</2>) to the <3>LLL</3> and <4>2500 cGy</4> out of <5>2500 cGy</5> to the ***** metastatic lesions, with *****. 02/14/15 <6>PET/CT</6>: New hypermetabolic <7>1.6 x 1.9 cm mesenteric lesion</7> with surrounding stranding suspicious for <8>metastasis</8>. Interval decrease in the size and metabolic activity of the metastatic nodules in the <9>left upper and lower lobe</9>, reflecting response to the recently completed <10>stereotactic ablative radiotherapy</10>. <11>Benign post radiation changes</11>. 03/28/15: <12>CT A/P</12> showed increase in the size of the <13>mesenteric nodule</13> along with further increase in ***** <14>19-9 level</14>. Subsequently seen by Dr. ***** ***** at ***** for consideration of *****-***** <15>pancreatic cancer trial</15> but was found to be ineligible due to low <16>IGF-1 level</16>, which was part of screening eligibility. 05/10/2015: Started <17>Gemcitabine</17> + <18>Abraxane</18> 06/27/2015: <19>Restaging CT</19> indicates stable disease in <20>lungs</20> but progression in enlarging <21>mesenteric nodule</21>. His <22>CA 19-9</22> continued to trend down and so patient was continued on *****/<23>Abraxane</23>. 08/15/2015: <24>CT</24> indicates stable disease. <25>Abraxane</25> d/c due to worsening <26>peripheral neuropathy</26>. 11/14/15: <27>CT scan</27> shows stable disease.
``` 
