s</34>, and now the presence of several small <35>hepatic lesions</35> c/w <36>metastases</36>.     She is now s/p 5 cycles of <37>chemotherapy</37> consisting of the combination of <38>capecitabine</38>/<39>temozolomide</39>. Doses originally consisted of <40>capecitabine 750 mg/m2 BID</40> days November 25
