an continues to feel quite well. He does have some <38>right upper quadrant discomfort</38> which he manages with <39>ibuprofen</39>. He has residual <40>low-grade neuropathy</40> in his feet but it is exacerbated by <41>cold temperature</41>.    He has had <42>germ line testing</42> and is
``` 
