34>GERD</34>  <35>degenerative disc disease</35>  <36>osteoarthritis</36>  bilateral <37>macular degeneration</37>    PRIOR SURGERIES:  <38>C-section</38> x2  <39>partial cystectomy</39> secondary to <40>endometriosis</40>, 1970    INJURIES:  None reported    CURRENT MEDICATIONS:  No 
