esponding to treatment    PLAN:    She will continue on <41>chemotherapy</41> without dose or schedule modification and we will also start <42>denosumab</42>. We plan <43>6 months</43> of treatment.    I spent <44>20 minutes</44> in face-to-face consultation with the patient today going over all aspects of her care and 
