s lesions</40>. VISIBLE ABDOMEN: Please see separate abdomen/pelvis CT report of the same date.<41>3 mm nodule</41> in the <42>right middle lobe</42> has decreased in attenuation since the previous exam. No new or increasing <43>metastatic disease</43> in the chest. Report dictated
