9> shows stable disease, however, patient was experiencing <30>renal dysfunction</30> probably due to <31>cisplatin</31> and not tolerating therapy well. *****/<32>Cis</32> was discontinued.     Patient was referred to screening for  clinical trials but she didn't have a good option due to the lack of biopsy tissue. We then pursued a management platform based on observation over the holidays for a few months.06/15/2019: <33>CT</33> reveals progression new <34>liver lesions</34>  06/22/2019: Attempted <35>Bx</35> of <36>liver lesion</36>, but no cancer cells seen.
