PO <1>antibiotics</1> on an outpatient basis, but was ultimately admitted to the <2>hospital</2> on 02/05/2021 to r/o <3>sepsis</3>. <4>ERCP</4> was performed on 02/09/2021 with <5>3 plastic stents</5> placed in the <6>right anterior</6>, <7>right posterior</7> and <8>left intrahepatic ducts</8>. Also noted was a suspected <9>abscess</9> coming off the <10>right anterior segment</10>. She was covered with <11>IV</11> -> <12>PO antibiotics</12> and d/c'ed to home on 02/12/2021.  - <13>Chemotherapy</13> resumed on 02/24/2021; completed one additional <14>cycle</14> of <15>rx</15> (last dose = 03/10/2021)  - Admitted to ***** (03/21/2021) 2o to <16>cholangitis</16> for which she was started on ***** *****. One day into hospitalization, experienced large <17>bloody BM</17> and acute drop in *****, with <18>hypotension</18> and <19>afib w/RVR</19>, that prompted transfer to *****. On <20>EGD</20> was found to have *****-***** <21>tear</21> that was banded. Subseq <22>ERCP</22> performed on 03/24/2021 with new <23>biliary stents</23> in both <24>left hepatic</24> and <25>right intrahepatic ducts</25>. D/c'ed to home on 03/28/2021 on <26>PO antibiotics</26>, and back on <27>Eliquis</27>.    Present review of systems  Persistent <28>upper abdominal/periumbilical pain</28>, somewhat crampy, not using any regular <29>analgesics</29>  Soft <30>BMs</30>, no notable <31>melena</31> or <32>bleeding</32>.  <33>Appetite sluggish</33>, no <34>N/V</34>.  Minimal <35>peripheral sensory neuropathy</35> a/w <36>chemotherapy</36>.  No <37>jaundice</37>.  No <38>fevers</38>/<39>chills</39>; completed course of <40>PO antibiotics</40> last week.  No <41>palpitations</41> or symptomatic <42>Afib</42> recently; no <43>shortness of breath</43>.
``` 
