41>cephalic and basilic DVT</41>  <42>hypogammaglobulinemia</42>    PRIOR SURGERIES:  <43>Left lung transplant</43>    INJURIES:  None reported    CURRENT MEDICATIONS:  Medications the patient states to be taking prior to today's encounter.   Medication Sig    <44>amLODIPine (NORVASC)</44> 5 mg tablet Take 1 tablet (5 mg 
