this upcoming week. However, she presented to <34>UCSF emergency room</34> on May 16 for evaluation of <35>anxiety</35> related to her diagnosis. <36>CT A/P</36> was repeated on 05/17/19 which demonstrates <37>3.4 x 3.4 x 4.7 cm hypoattenuating mass</37> at the 
