ction Type Reactions    <31>Codeine</31> Not Specified 06/07/2019    <32>Nausea And Vomiting</32>, <33>Dizziness</33>    <34>Morphine (pf)</34> Low 06/07/2019    <35>Nausea And Vomiting</35>, <36>Anxiety</36>Current 
