epartment of Radiology and Biomedical Imaging <43>Cancer Staging</43> <44>Malignant neoplasm of pancreas (HCC)</44> Staging form: <45>Exocrine Pancreas, AJCC 8th Edition</45> - Clinical: <46>Stage Unknown</46> (*****, *****) - Unsigned ASSESSMENT & PLAN In summary, ***** *****-***** is a <47>58 y.o.</47>
