r <16>Pain</16>.        <17>HYDROCODONE/ACETAMINOPHEN</17> (<18>VICODIN ORAL</18>)  Take by mouth.        <19>ONDANSETRON</19> IN 0.9 % <20>NACL/PF</20> (<21>ONDANSETRON</21>, *****, ***** *****, *****, <22>IV</22>) Inject into the vein.        <23>prochlorperazine</23> (<24>COMPAZINE</24>) 10 mg tablet Take 10 mg by mouth 3 (three) times daily.
