ltation with Dr. *****. Because he had a history of <37>BRCA2 mutation</37> in his family, we elected to wait for his <38>germ line testing</38> before initiating therapy. Testing revealed no <39>pathogenic mutations</39>.    06/07/22: ***** <40>2.5</40>  07/15/22: <41>CA 19-9</41> <42><2</42>    07/20/22: Restaging 
