= 1Medications the patient states to be taking prior to today's encounter.   Medication Sig    <43>ascorbic acid</43>, <44>vitamin C</44>, (<45>VITAMIN C</45>) 250 mg tablet Take 250 mg by mouth Daily.    <46>atorvastatin</46> (<47>LIPITOR</47>) 10 mg tablet 5 mg Daily.     <48>CALCIUM ORAL</48> Take by mouth.
