ner_results: ```plaintext
09/23/2012. He did not receive any further adjuvant treatment thereafter. F/u <1>CT scans</1> in late April 2013 showed new evidence of <2>metastatic disease</2> involving the <3>liver</3>. On this basis, he re-started <4>chemotherapy</4>, this time consisting of the combination of <5>gemcitabine</5> plus <6>*****-paclitaxel</6> initially on a 3-week-on, 1-week-off schedule. This has required <7>growth factor support</7> after day 15 of each treatment cycle, a dose reduction early on of the <8>*****-paclitaxel</8> due to <9>peripheral sensory neuropathy</9>, and an eventual change to a dosing schedule of two weeks on/two weeks off. He has remained on treatment to the present time. He has demonstrated a nice <10>*****-9 biomarker</10> decline on therapy, most recently measuring <11>80</11> on most recent measurement (down from a starting value in the <12>400s</12>). Serial imaging has been performed here at *****; most recent <13>CT scans</13> from last week show essentially stable findings in his <14>hepatic metastases</14> and <15>nodal metastases</15> (see below). On present review of systems, the patient continues to do well overall and is staying active, although he did note slightly more difficulty with his most recent cycle of <16>chemotherapy</16>. He has some cumulative non-debilitating <17>peripheral sensory neuropathy</17> involving <18>feet</18> > <19>hands</19>. He has occasional mild <20>epigastric discomfort</20>, and a solitary episode of <21>postprandial vomiting</21> two weeks ago. <22>BMs</22> are frequent and regular. He has had no recent <23>fevers</23>, <24>chills</24>, or infectious complications. The remainder of the patient's review of systems was negative. Medications the patient states to be taking prior to today's encounter. Medication Sig blood <25>glucose</25> (ONE ***** ULTRA TEST) <26>test strip</26> Please check sugars as directed by MD. insulin <27>aspart</27> (<28>NOVOLOG FLEXPEN</28>) 100 unit/mL <29>PENINSULN</29> injection pen Breakfast <30>4 units aspart</30> ***** <31>4 units aspart</31> ***** <32>4 units of aspart</32> 6pm <33>6 units aspart</33> And use correctional sliding scale (below) insulin <34>glargine</34> (<35>LANTUS SOLOSTAR</35>) 100 unit/mL
``` 
