ner_results: ```plaintext
12/07/16: <1>CT cap</1> - No evidence of intrathoracic metastatic disease. Postsurgical changes status post <2>distal pancreatectomy</2> and <3>splenectomy</3>, including a small fluid collection anterior to the <4>pancreatic head</4>. Mildly enlarged <5>gastrohepatic lymph node</5> and fat stranding at the resection bed, nonspecific in the recently postoperative setting. 

12/22/16: <6>C1D1 of gemcitabine + capecitabine</6> 

01/13/17: <7>gemcitabine + capecitabine</7> 

02/03/17: <8>gemcitabine + capecitabine</8> 

02/24/17: <9>gemcitabine + capecitabine</9> 

02/28/17: Established care with Dr. ***** and started <10>120 mg sq</10> 

03/03/17: <11>gemcitabine + capecitabine</11> not given due to low <12>ANC (0.2)</12> 

03/15/17: <13>CT CAP</13>: No evidence of disease recurrence. 

03/17/17: <14>gemcitabine + capecitabine</14> 

03/24/17: <15>gemcitabine + capecitabine</15> 

03/28/17: <16>Lupron 22.5 mg IM</16> 

04/07/17: <17>gemcitabine + capecitabine</17> 

04/14/17: <18>gemcitabine + capecitabine</18> CANCELLED (due to <19>ANC 0.58</19>), <20>120 mg sq x 3</20> 

04/21/17: <21>gemcitabine + capecitabine</21> (no <22>gemcitabine + capecitabine</22> between days February 15 of cycle) 

04/28/17: <23>gemcitabine + capecitabine</23> DEFERRED (due to <24>ANC 0.86</24>), <25>120 mg sq x 3</25> 

05/05/17: <26>gemcitabine + capecitabine</26> 

Interim History He had <27>neck pain</27> and <28>joint pain</28> in the <29>LE</29> after the last cycle. He took <30>Claritin</30> and <31>ibuprofen</31> and this helped. He has lower energy after the <32>infusion</32>. His appetite is good and he denies any weight loss. His <33>BM</33> are regular. His <34>libido</34> is lower. He is planning on <35>prostatectomy</35> in early September.
``` 
