ditional metastasis.       <42>03/26/16</42> - Seen by Dr. ***** ***** in *****.   -Though she certainly does have diffuse degenerative changes in her <43>lumbar spine</43>, as well as <44>metastatic lesions</44> in her <45>L1</45> and <46>L3 bodies</46> however, there is no focal compression of <47>neurologic elements</47>, no compromise in mechanical
