<1>FENOFIBRATE</1> (***** ORAL) Take by mouth.      <2>fluticasone</2> (<3>FLONASE</3>) <4>50 mcg/actuation nasal spray</4> <5>50 mcg</5> by Nasal route Daily.    <6>HYDROcodone-acetaminophen</6> (<7>LORTAB</7>, <8>VICODIN</8>) <9>2.5-500 mg per tablet</9> Take 1 tablet by mouth once as needed.     <10>hydrocortisone</10> <11>2.5 % cream</11> Apply twice daily as needed on the face    <12>INSULIN ASPART</12> (<13>NOVOLOG SUBCUT</13>) Inject into the skin.    <14>insulin glargine</14> (<15>LANTUS</15>) <16>100 unit/mL injection</16> Inject into the skin nightly at bedtime.      <17>insulin lispro</17> (<18>HUMALOG</18>) <19>100 unit/mL CARTRG</19> Inject into the skin 4 (four) times daily.      <20>insulin syringes</20>, disposable, <21>1 mL SYRINGE</21> syringe Dispense #45 for use with <22>octreotide injection</22>    <23>lipase-protease-amylase</23> (*****) <24>6,000-19,000 -30,000 unit CAPDREC capsule</24> Take 2 capsules by mouth 3 (three) times daily with meals.    <25>losartan</25> (<26>COZAAR</26>) <27>25 mg tablet</27>     <28>mupirocin</28> (<29>BACTROBAN</29>) <30>2 % ointment</30> Apply twice daily as directed    <31>octreotide</31> (<32>SANDOSTATIN</32>) <33>500 mcg/mL SOLN injection</33> Inject <34>150mcg SQ TID x 10 days</34>    <35>ONETOUCH ULTRA TEST</35> test strip     <36>PARoxetine</36> (<37>PAXIL</37>) <38>20 mg tablet</38>     <39>pregabalin</39> (*****) <40>100 mg capsule</40> Take <41>100 mg</41> by mouth Twice a day.    <42>triamcinolone</42> (<43>KENALOG</43>) <44>0.1 % cream</44> Apply twice daily as needed on arms trunk/legs    <45>urea</45> (<46>CARMOL</46>) <47>40 % cream</47> Use daily as needed for skin thickening on feet.    [DISCONTINUED] <48>triamcinolone</48> (<49>KENALOG</49>) <50>0.1 % lotion</50> Apply twice daily as needed    [DISCONTINUED] <51>TRIAMTERENE</51> <52>MISC</52> Take <53>25 mg</53> by mouth Daily. Dose, strength, route or frequency not available.
