my</46>. <47>Perirectal fat stranding</47> and <48>hypermetabolism of the rectum</48>, similar compared to prior. Musculoskeletal: Otherwise <49>unremarkable</49>. IMPRESSION: 1. <50>Nodular soft tissue</50> along the <51>right lower lobe suture line</51> with a focus of <52>hypermetabolism</52>, similar in size compared to <53>08/11/2019</53> but
