he <37>bladder</37>, or at the right <38>UVJ</38>. Mild right <39>hydronephrosis</39> is present. Left <40>kidney</40> is <41>atrophic</41>. ASSESSMENT: 1. <42>Metastatic adenocarcinoma</42> the <43>pancreas</43> with radiographic and <44>CA-19-9</44> evidence of improved <45>tumor control</45> 2. <46>ECOG</46> September 15 3.
